        "id": 224116,
        "name": "Lorkenpeist",
        "username": "Lorkenpeist",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lorkenpeist/{size}/1959_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-08T02:08:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, playing a power card is not the same as resolving its effects. It just means that the newly played card can be resolved normally at some point during the fast/slow phase, just as if it had been played during the spirit phase. So in particular, its effects would&nbsp;<em>not&nbsp;</em>interrupt the power that let you play it (or let you resolve a slow power during fast phase), and in fact you can resolve other powers in between.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:25.375Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 18715,
        "topic_slug": "more-order-of-play-interrupting-aspects",
        "display_username": "Lorkenpeist",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Also, playing a power card is not the same as resolving its effects. It just means that the newly played card can be resolved normally at some point during the fast/slow phase, just as if it had been played during the spirit phase. So in particular, its effects would&nbsp;<em>not&nbsp;</em>interrupt the power that let you play it (or let you resolve a slow power during fast phase), and in fact you can resolve other powers in between.&nbsp;</p>",
